request.description:
### GET /api/v3/workspaces/{{Workspace ID Items}}/items/{{DMS ID Item}}/attachments

This endpoint retrieves the attachments associated with a specific item in a workspace.

#### Request

No request body parameters are required for this endpoint.

- `Base URL` (string) - The base URL for the API.

- `Workspace ID Items` (string) - The ID of the workspace.

- `DMS ID Item` (string) - The ID of the item.


#### Response

The response will be in JSON format with the following schema:

``` json
{
  "item": {
    "link": "",
    "urn": "",
    "title": "",
    "deleted": true
  },
  "attachments": [
    {
      "selfLink": "",
      "urn": "",
      "name": "",
      "url": "",
      "thumbnails": {
        "small": "",
        "medium": "",
        "large": ""
      },
      "id": 0,
      "description": "",
      "size": 0,
      "version": 0,
      "status": {
        "name": "",
        "label": "",
        "description": ""
      },
      "type": {
        "id": "",
        "fileType": "",
        "iconImage": "",
        "viewable": true,
        "extension": ""
      },
      "resourceName": "",
      "created": {
        "user": {
          "link": "",
          "urn": "",
          "title": "",
          "status": "",
          "email": "",
          "image": {
            "small": "",
            "medium": "",
            "large": ""
          }
        },
        "timeStamp": ""
      },
      "folder": null,
      "markups": {
        "link": "",
        "deleted": true,
        "count": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}

 ```

